{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "studymate", "elements": [{"id": "c1b3fef30ff14137", "type": "text", "x": 30, "y": 22, "width": 209.00000000000003, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 91888746, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 646967376, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Economics · Scene 3", "originalText": "Economics · Scene 3", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "6738cae20afc4c30", "type": "text", "x": 666.9, "y": 60, "width": 266.20000000000005, "height": 55.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 66597224, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 578600103, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Equilibrium", "originalText": "Equilibrium", "fontSize": 44, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "29a35c8097334356", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1230, "y": 180, "width": 320, "height": 190, "angle": 0.03, "strokeColor": "#e8c547", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1015220940, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 832383096, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "c52d4322b0794389", "type": "text", "x": 1250, "y": 200, "width": 290.40000000000003, "height": 137.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 916835694, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 848177450, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The equilibrium price is\nwhere the two curves\ncross: the amount buyers\nwant equals the amount\nsellers offer.", "originalText": "The equilibrium price is\nwhere the two curves\ncross: the amount buyers\nwant equals the amount\nsellers offer.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "d49460bbd51a4f54", "type": "rectangle", "x": 120, "y": 728.0, "width": 1360, "height": 142.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "#343a40", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 954816442, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 288083024, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "18fc973f0b774618", "type": "text", "x": 145, "y": 743.0, "width": 1078.0, "height": 100.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 784947490, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 209281551, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The equilibrium price is where the two curves cross: the amount buyers want equals the amount\nsellers offer. If the price is above it there is a surplus and prices tend to fall; below it there\nis a shortage and prices tend to rise. Example: if demand is Qd = 100 - 2P and supply is Qs = 20 +\n2P, they are equal when 100 - 2P = 20 + 2P, so P = 20 and Q = 60.", "originalText": "The equilibrium price is where the two curves cross: the amount buyers want equals the amount\nsellers offer. If the price is above it there is a surplus and prices tend to fall; below it there\nis a shortage and prices tend to rise. Example: if demand is Qd = 100 - 2P and supply is Qs = 20 +\n2P, they are equal when 100 - 2P = 20 + 2P, so P = 20 and Q = 60.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "c591a290fe234495", "type": "rectangle", "x": 176.78333333333336, "y": 379.5, "width": 173.10000000000002, "height": 91.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#FF6347", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 511025151, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 280080821, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "9cca219a3ce84a02", "type": "text"}, {"id": "3aabbb37dd1c4395", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "fb1f7513dd60463c", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "9cca219a3ce84a02", "type": "text", "x": 196.78333333333336, "y": 397.5, "width": 133.10000000000002, "height": 55.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 794472659, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1018022224, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Equilibrium\nprice", "originalText": "Equilibrium\nprice", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "c591a290fe234495", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "bad3c25c551d4cc5", "type": "rectangle", "x": 543.